-- The two audiences the proxy cells are configured for, each with the
-- loopback port its forwards leave by. The rows differ only in DID and port,
-- so a call admitted for one and routed to the other shows up as a `port=`
-- naming the wrong row. The first row is also the default audience, the one
-- a request with no `atproto-proxy` header is forwarded to.
